Package: SDDQA
Title: Sequence Data Decontamination and Quality Assurance
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Samantha", "Setta", , "ssetta@uw.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"), 
            comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9075-7573"))
Description: This package uses sequencing data to run decontamination with 
              negative and positive controls, merge sequences across multiple 
              sequencing runs based on sequence exact matching, run depth, 
              diversity, replicate filtering, and finally run the last quality 
              and optional filtering steps.
